# Smart Contacts — Tauri build-time environment variables.
# Copy to `.env` (NOT committed) and fill in values before `pnpm tauri build`.

# Google OAuth Desktop App Client ID (from Google Cloud Console).
# Steps:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com/ → create or select project
#   2. Enable "People API"
#   3. OAuth consent screen → External, scope contacts.readonly
#   4. Credentials → Create OAuth client ID → type "Desktop app"
#   5. Copy the Client ID (NOT the secret — desktop apps use PKCE, no secret needed)
#
# Vite picks up only VITE_-prefixed env vars; this is read by
# shared/src/google/contacts/oauth/config.ts.
VITE_SMART_CONTACTS_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
